  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">World Fish - Strategic Partnership in Aquaculture</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will work with vocational training centers to build capability and design practical and innovative training tools that promote the use of appropriate technologies to support the development of medium- to -small-scale entrepreneurs in the aquaculture sector, fish farm workers and students in Zambia and Tanzania (especially women and female youth). There is also intention of including component managed by BluePlanet with among others an online course.</narrative>
  </description>
